# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# A yule-log screen from parts: a firebox cut into a wall with colour layers,
# library fire boxed into it (`lighten`, so its dark gaps leave the soot-black
# firebox showing), a log pile in front, and a second pattern — a one-colour
# wash, breathing — ADDED over everything as the glow the fire throws on the
# room. Text slot 0 is for a message (`/api/text`); empty, it draws nothing.
S - Hearth
U 32 32
L color 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Wall
K 2a1008
L color 2 4 28 2 normal 100 none fill 1
N Mantel
K 4a2414
L color 4 6 24 26 normal 100 none fill 1
N Firebox
K 080302
L pat 4 6 24 26 lighten 100 none fill 1
N Fire
I @pat/perlin-fire
C sliderFlameHeightPct 5898240
L sprite 4 22 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Logs
I @spr/log-pile
L pat 0 0 0 0 add 30 none fill 1
N Glow
I @pat/color-wash
C sliderStops 65536
C sliderScheme 0
C hsvPickerColorA 3932 65536 65536
C sliderMotion 0
C sliderBreathSeconds 262144
C sliderFloorPercent 2621440
L text 0 0 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Message
T slot 0
F tiny ffd9b0 c left 10
